This crate contains code derived from libfreenect, the OpenKinect project's
userspace driver for the Kinect (https://github.com/OpenKinect/libfreenect):

- src/registration.rs is a port of src/registration.c (depth-to-millimetre
  and depth-to-color mapping).
- The camera command, register, stream packet and motor protocols and their
  constants follow src/cameras.c, src/flags.c, src/tilt.c and
  src/usb_libusb10.c.

